	"system": {
		"description": "<p>The four nations provide the following benefits when you expend 1 exertion while dashing:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Water/Earth:</strong> Your movement does not provoke opportunity attacks until the end of your next turn.</p></li><li><p><strong>Fire/Air:</strong> You gain a +10ft movement speed bonus during this dash action and a 10ft increase to your jump height and distance until the end of your next turn.</p></li></ul>",
